# Static Snare: "for each attacking creature" counts the caster's own attackers too. Bot1 attacks with its Ornithopter on turn 3, so
# the Snare flashed in at the declare attackers step costs {3}{W}: four Mox Pearls pay it exactly. Its trigger takes an artifact
# that is not a creature, Bot2's Mox Pearl; the exile lasts until Bot1's Snare leaves.

